{"slug":"insert-greatest-common-divisors-in-linked-list","title":"Insert Greatest Common Divisors in Linked List","level":"Medium","summary":"Between every pair of adjacent nodes, insert a new node whose value is the greatest common divisor of the pair. Return the head.","method":"insertGreatestCommonDivisors","params":[["ListNode","head"]],"returns":"ListNode","tests":[{"in":["[18,6,10,3]"],"out":"[18,6,6,2,10,1,3]"},{"in":["[7]"],"out":"[7]"},{"in":["[2,4]"],"out":"[2,2,4]"},{"in":["[1000,1000,999]"],"out":"[1000,1000,1000,1,999]"},{"in":["[12,18,27,7]"],"out":"[12,6,18,9,27,1,7]"},{"in":["[643,643,643]"],"out":"[643,643,643,643,643]","g":1},{"in":["[869]"],"out":"[869]","g":1},{"in":["[562]"],"out":"[562]","g":1},{"in":["[12,9,12,8,12]"],"out":"[12,3,9,3,12,4,8,4,12]","g":1},{"in":["[63]"],"out":"[63]","g":1},{"in":["[10,10,12,12]"],"out":"[10,10,10,2,12,12,12]","g":1},{"in":["[748]"],"out":"[748]","g":1},{"in":["[3,8,2,12,2,1,4]"],"out":"[3,1,8,2,2,2,12,2,2,1,1,1,4]","g":1},{"in":["[12]"],"out":"[12]","g":1},{"in":["[700,700]"],"out":"[700,700,700]","g":1},{"in":["[625]"],"out":"[625]","g":1},{"in":["[2,1,4,5,5,8,10,1,9,1,4]"],"out":"[2,1,1,1,4,1,5,5,5,1,8,2,10,1,1,1,9,1,1,1,4]","g":1},{"in":["[8,9,1,1,12,2,8,3,9,6]"],"out":"[8,1,9,1,1,1,1,1,12,2,2,2,8,1,3,3,9,3,6]","g":1},{"in":["[1]"],"out":"[1]","g":1},{"in":["[10,9,7,7,5,5,4,3,2,2]"],"out":"[10,1,9,1,7,7,7,1,5,5,5,1,4,1,3,1,2,2,2]","g":1},{"in":["[781]"],"out":"[781]","g":1},{"in":["[9]"],"out":"[9]","g":1},{"in":["[1,5,2,3,11,12]"],"out":"[1,1,5,1,2,1,3,1,11,1,12]","g":1},{"in":["[3]"],"out":"[3]","g":1},{"in":["[12,12,12,12,8,2,1,1,1]"],"out":"[12,12,12,12,12,12,12,4,8,2,2,1,1,1,1,1,1]","g":1},{"in":["[982,1,941,1000,1000,434,1,495,1,503,749,781,53,777,181,1,749,688,1000,138]"],"out":"[982,1,1,1,941,1,1000,1000,1000,2,434,1,1,1,495,1,1,1,503,1,749,1,781,1,53,1,777,1,181,1,1,1,749,1,688,8,1000,2,138]","g":1},{"in":["[9,9,9,12,9,12,9]"],"out":"[9,9,9,9,9,3,12,3,9,3,12,3,9]","g":1},{"in":["[10,5,10,5,5,10,10,10,5,5]"],"out":"[10,5,5,5,10,5,5,5,5,5,10,10,10,10,10,5,5,5,5]","g":1},{"in":["[1,12]"],"out":"[1,1,12]","g":1},{"in":["[10,10,3,10,3,10,3]"],"out":"[10,10,10,1,3,1,10,1,3,1,10,1,3]","g":1},{"in":["[558,1,201,703,219,111,864,152,667,1000,1]"],"out":"[558,1,1,1,201,1,703,1,219,3,111,3,864,8,152,1,667,1,1000,1,1]","g":1},{"in":["[1,1]"],"out":"[1,1,1]","g":1},{"in":["[535]"],"out":"[535]","g":1},{"in":["[398]"],"out":"[398]","g":1},{"in":["[9,5]"],"out":"[9,1,5]","g":1},{"in":["[5,8,11,6,7,5,9,5,6,11,5,7,6]"],"out":"[5,1,8,1,11,1,6,1,7,1,5,1,9,1,5,1,6,1,11,1,5,1,7,1,6]","g":1},{"in":["[11]"],"out":"[11]","g":1},{"in":["[4,3,1]"],"out":"[4,1,3,1,1]","g":1},{"in":["[6,5,3,9,4,7,9,2,2,2,9]"],"out":"[6,1,5,1,3,3,9,1,4,1,7,1,9,1,2,2,2,2,2,1,9]","g":1},{"in":["[1,545,1,545,1,545]"],"out":"[1,1,545,1,1,1,545,1,1,1,545]","g":1},{"in":["[454,455,459,451,455,455,455]"],"out":"[454,1,455,1,459,1,451,1,455,455,455,455,455]","g":1},{"in":["[823,823]"],"out":"[823,823,823]","g":1},{"in":["[557]"],"out":"[557]","g":1},{"in":["[354,353,351]"],"out":"[354,1,353,1,351]","g":1},{"in":["[710,930,347,223]"],"out":"[710,10,930,1,347,1,223]","g":1}],"lesson":"linked-list-manipulation","statement":"For every pair of adjacent nodes in the list, insert a new node between them whose value is the **greatest common divisor** (GCD) of the two values. Return the head of the resulting list.\n\nThe GCD of two numbers is the largest positive integer that divides both.","constraints":["1 <= head.nodes <= 5000","1 <= head.val <= 1000"],"hints":["Walk the list with a pointer a. While a has a next node b, a new node goes between them.","Create the node with value gcd(a.val, b.val), point it at b, and point a at it. Then jump to b (two steps), so you never insert next to a node you just created.","Euclid's algorithm: gcd(a, b) = gcd(b, a mod b), and gcd(a, 0) = a."],"explain":"gcd(18, 6) = 6, gcd(6, 10) = 2 and gcd(10, 3) = 1, so those values go between the pairs: `[18,6,6,2,10,1,3]`."},
{"slug":"copy-list-with-random-pointer","title":"Copy List with Random Pointer","level":"Medium","summary":"Each node has next and random (any node or null). Return a deep copy: brand-new nodes with the same values, wired the same way. Lists are written as [[val, randomIndex or null], …].","method":"copyRandomList","params":[["Node","head"]],"returns":"Node","uses":["RandomNode"],"call":"Node orig = BCBR.build($0); Object r = BCBR.dump(s.copyRandomList(orig), orig);","tests":[{"in":["[[7,null],[13,0],[11,4],[10,2],[1,0]]"],"out":"[[7,null],[13,0],[11,4],[10,2],[1,0]]"},{"in":["[[1,1],[2,1]]"],"out":"[[1,1],[2,1]]"},{"in":["[[3,null],[3,0],[3,null]]"],"out":"[[3,null],[3,0],[3,null]]"},{"in":["[]"],"out":"[]"},{"in":["[[5,0]]"],"out":"[[5,0]]"},{"in":["[[-1,3],[0,3],[9,null],[4,1]]"],"out":"[[-1,3],[0,3],[9,null],[4,1]]"},{"in":["[[-8951,0],[-8951,1],[-8948,null],[-8949,null],[-8949,4],[-8952,0],[-8952,14],[-8948,7],[-8951,null],[-8949,0],[-8951,null],[-8949,14],[-8950,null],[-8952,null],[-8949,null]]"],"out":"[[-8951,0],[-8951,1],[-8948,null],[-8949,null],[-8949,4],[-8952,0],[-8952,14],[-8948,7],[-8951,null],[-8949,0],[-8951,null],[-8949,14],[-8950,null],[-8952,null],[-8949,null]]","g":1},{"in":["[[-1388,0]]"],"out":"[[-1388,0]]","g":1},{"in":["[[7065,1],[7064,1]]"],"out":"[[7065,1],[7064,1]]","g":1},{"in":["[[1,0],[1,null]]"],"out":"[[1,0],[1,null]]","g":1},{"in":["[[-9616,null],[6688,1],[-5902,null],[-10000,null],[-7203,null],[-3366,12],[8591,null],[3810,3],[10000,8],[2058,1],[-10000,12],[5621,null],[-2065,12]]"],"out":"[[-9616,null],[6688,1],[-5902,null],[-10000,null],[-7203,null],[-3366,12],[8591,null],[3810,3],[10000,8],[2058,1],[-10000,12],[5621,null],[-2065,12]]","g":1},{"in":["[[7199,0],[9242,4],[-1553,1],[7251,4],[1560,4]]"],"out":"[[7199,0],[9242,4],[-1553,1],[7251,4],[1560,4]]","g":1},{"in":["[[381,13],[-10000,6],[9479,2],[3515,null],[9298,null],[-3750,0],[10000,13],[7250,3],[-10000,8],[4466,4],[-10000,10],[10000,0],[-1724,0],[2411,10]]"],"out":"[[381,13]